  "reasoning": "The defendant contracted land for a rice cooperative but, without any legal land-use permits, built storage and drying facilities on cultivated land. Despite multiple administrative notices to stop the illegal activity, the defendant continued to occupy 14.79 mu of arable land. This conduct constitutes the criminal offense of illegally occupying farmland (非法占用农用地). No other criminal elements (e.g., fraud, damage, etc.) are present in the facts.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]非法占用农用地<eoa>"
